#: ../../synchronization.rst:9
msgid "Synchronization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:11
msgid ""
"A synchronization run reads the school data from the LDAP directory, "
"writes it to CSV files, packs the files into a ZIP archive, and uploads "
"the archive to Apple School Manager. This chapter describes the run "
"itself and the data that it transfers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:21
msgid "Run the synchronization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:23
msgid "Three things start a synchronization run:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:25
msgid "The cron job from :ref:`configuration-schedule`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:27
msgid "Saving the app settings, if you enabled ``asm/run_on_appsetting_save``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:30
msgid "The command :command:`asm-upload` on the command line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:32
msgid "Start a synchronization run manually"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:37
msgid ""
"The command writes progress messages to the terminal and a more detailed "
"protocol to :file:`/var/log/univention/asm.log`. It exits with a non-zero"
" status if the credentials are missing or if the upload fails."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:46
msgid "What happens during a run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:48
msgid ""
"The connector reads the user name from ``asm/username`` and the password "
"from :file:`/etc/asm.secret`. A missing value stops the run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:52
msgid ""
"The connector collects the schools, classes, work groups, teachers, and "
"students from the LDAP directory, restricted by ``asm/school_whitelist`` "
"and by the LDAP filters from :ref:`configuration-ldap-filter`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:57
msgid ""
"The connector writes the six CSV files from :ref:`synchronization-csv-"
"files` to a temporary directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:60
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The connector packs the CSV files into "
":file:`/var/lib/asm/asm_{timestamp}.zip` and removes the temporary "
"directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:64
msgid ""
"The connector opens an SFTP connection to "
"``upload.appleschoolcontent.com`` and uploads the archive as "
":file:`archive.zip`. It verifies the host key against "
":file:`/etc/asm_public_key`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:69
msgid ""
"The connector sets ``asm/last_upload`` to the current time and deletes "
"the archive, unless you enabled ``asm/store_zip``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:73
msgid ""
"Every run transfers the complete data set. The connector doesn't track "
"what changed since the last run."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:79
msgid "How Apple School Manager applies the data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:81
msgid ""
"Apple School Manager compares the uploaded data with the accounts that it"
" holds:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:84
msgid "A user that appears for the first time gets a new account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:86
msgid ""
"A user that is no longer in the upload is deactivated immediately and "
"deleted after 30 days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../synchronization.rst:89
msgid ""
"A user whose attributes changed keeps the account, as long as the "
"``person_id`` column is unchanged. See :ref:`configuration-person-id`."
msgstr ""

